  "solution": {
    "text": "Compounds which are more acidic than H<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3&nbsp;</sub>will dissolve in NaHCO<sub>3.</sub>&nbsp;So, option c and d will be soluble in NaHCO<sub>3</sub>&nbsp;",
